      "m_dialogList": {
        "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
        "m_dialogs": [
          {
            "m_dialogTag": "Completion",
            "m_dialogEntries": [
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-BLUE-NPC11_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Seekers of Knowledge, how can I guide your quest?",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Khrulhu_PriestF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Soulik_Alasahpa_AH-BLUE_006.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752307,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-BLUE-NPC11_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Tell us of the magic you studied, of the Ahmarra you harnessed.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Zander_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Zander_AH-BLUE_145.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752266,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-BLUE-NPC11_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Ah, yes, the Ahmarric Threads feed our great power, each thread in different ways. Many laponas studied them in many different places. Many study them still.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Khrulhu_PriestF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Soulik_Alasahpa_AH-BLUE_007.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752307,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-BLUE-NPC11_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Yes, but which threads did they study and where?",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Zander_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Zander_AH-BLUE_146.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752266,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-BLUE-NPC11_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "That knowledge I cannot share with those who are not of my kind. We created Akashic Records to preserve us...",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Khrulhu_PriestF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Soulik_Alasahpa_AH-BLUE_008.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752307,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-BLUE-NPC11_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "...But as Balaur and his teachings spread, the chances of rogue entities finding us increases. Thus we shield some secrets from all but ourselves.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Khrulhu_PriestF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Soulik_Alasahpa_AH-BLUE_009.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752307,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-BLUE-NPC11_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "And how would your Akashic Records recognize someone as one of you?",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Zander_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Zander_AH-BLUE_147.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752266,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-BLUE-NPC11_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "The Akasha reads the mind and soul of those it touches and stores them in the Manifest. Any can view these records... if they can survive its guardians.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Khrulhu_PriestF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Soulik_Alasahpa_AH-BLUE_010.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752307,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-BLUE-NPC11_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "The Akasha protects identity with identity. Know yourselves as we know you or flee.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Khrulhu_PriestF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Soulik_Alasahpa_AH-BLUE_011.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752307,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-BLUE-NPC11_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Huzzah, then. Let's go, Wizard.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Zander_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Zander_AH-BLUE_148.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752266,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              }
